<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH KOMERCNI IF 9MO LOSS CZK 638.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>CZECH KOMERCNI IF 9MO LOSS CZK 638.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine month period</p>
<p>ending Aug 30 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p> Gross profit/loss     -638.691    vs     +77.919</p>
<p> Operating profit	-180.478    vs    -148.675</p>
<p> Assets		 +12,034.558    vs  +9,244.866</p>
<p> Basic capital	 +9,315.242    vs  +9,315.242</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is IPF Komercni Banky a.s. The</p>
<p>compnay is an investment fund. It is traded on the Prague Stock</p>
<p>Exchange and its shares are measured on the Reuters RPIX index</p>
<p>of continuously traded shares.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
